@title Kingdom Hearts - Chain of Memories (USA)
@file Kingdom Hearts - Chain of Memories (U).gba
@game B8CE
@chip SRAM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: nothing is written to SRAM through New Game, the Marluxia card-battle tutorial and the Castle Oblivion intro; the first save needs map cards used on Traverse Town doors to reach a save point (Moment's Reprieve), and the town rooms come out different on each emulator (see below), so no frozen walk through them exists

# Dialogue only advances on a firm press: A with hold=8. New Game > file 1 >
# opening > Marluxia's tutorial (jump, dodge roll, reload by holding A on the
# reload icon; "Selecting Cards" ends after cycling with R; the "Changing
# Categories" prompt wants SELECT twice) > Castle Oblivion intro and the
# first memory door > Traverse Town.
# Finding (traverse_town, f31927, Sora standing in the entrance door of the
# first Traverse Town room on all three): the room is furnished differently on
# each emulator: a street lamp and a crate box on dingbat-bios, a two-storey
# building with a Heartless symbol on mgba, a crate box and paved circles on
# nba. Everything up to the memory door (memory_door, f31127) is identical.

[new]
# until text PRESS timeout=1500 every=10  [reached dingbat-bios+990 mgba+990 nba+980]
wait 994
wait 150
checkpoint title window=0 compare=text
press START
# until text 'NEW GAME' timeout=300 every=5  [reached dingbat-bios+10 mgba+10 nba+10]
wait 14
wait 150
press A
# until text 'Select a file' timeout=600 every=5  [reached dingbat-bios+95 mgba+95 nba+95]
wait 99
wait 30
checkpoint file_select window=0
press A
# mash A until text Castle timeout=12000 every=60 hold=8  [taps dingbat-bios:141 mgba:141 nba:141]
tap A times=141 every=60 hold=8
# mash A until text 'Dodge Roll' timeout=12000 every=30 hold=8  [taps dingbat-bios:341 mgba:341 nba:341]
tap A times=341 every=30 hold=8
checkpoint tutorial window=0 compare=text
press B after=60
press RIGHT hold=4 after=4
press RIGHT hold=4 after=60
# mash A until text Reloading timeout=3000 every=30 hold=8  [taps dingbat-bios:70 mgba:70 nba:70]
tap A times=70 every=30 hold=8
press A hold=90 after=10
# mash A until text 'Selecting Cards' timeout=3000 every=30 hold=8  [taps dingbat-bios:20 mgba:20 nba:20]
tap A times=20 every=30 hold=8
checkpoint selecting_cards window=0 compare=text
press R hold=4 after=16
press R hold=4 after=16
press A hold=8 after=60
tap R times=10 every=16 hold=4
tap L times=10 every=16 hold=4
press A hold=8 after=50
press A hold=8 after=50
press A hold=8 after=50
press A hold=8 after=50
press A hold=8 after=50
press A hold=8 after=50
press A hold=8 after=50
press A hold=8 after=50
press A hold=8 after=50
press A hold=8 after=50
checkpoint changing_categories window=0 compare=text
press SELECT hold=8 after=60
press A hold=8 after=60
press SELECT hold=8 after=60
press A hold=8 after=60
tap A times=8 every=58 hold=8
tap A times=30 every=60 hold=8
tap A times=30 every=60 hold=8
tap A times=30 every=60 hold=8
tap A times=10 every=60 hold=8
tap A times=5 every=60 hold=8
checkpoint memory_door window=0
tap A times=5 every=60 hold=8
wait 200
wait 300
checkpoint traverse_town window=0 compare=none

